      <p>
        Because HRA applies directly as a multiplier on basic pay, the expansion of the basic wage floor under the 8th CPC will substantially increase monthly housing allowances. The table below illustrates this across key matrix ranks in a Class X Metro (30% rate) assuming a 2.86x fitment factor:
